- 86,304 updates.
- 96 snapshots.
- Every snapshot contains exactly 5000 bids and 5000 asks.
- Every observed price level contains exactly 3 fields.
- 30,026,353 individual price-level records observed.
- No out-of-order timestamps.
- No repeated timestamps.
- No sequence or update ID exists in this historical format.
- Top-level fields are `instId`, `action`, `ts`, `asks`, and `bids`.
- Archive uses a UTC calendar day.
- Physical schema and reconstruction model match OKX Spot L2.
- Quantity semantics differ: derivative quantities represent contracts.

### Compatibility

Compatible with OKX Spot L2:

