### Normalization Requirements

```text
ZIP
 ↓
CSV
 ↓
parse OKX-T1 rows
 ↓
preserve instrument_name
 ↓
interpret trade_id within instrument
 ↓
interpret size as option contracts
 ↓
sort by created_time when global chronological order is required
```

Do not assume:

```text
