Current evidence suggests:

```text
Trades
────────────────────────────────

Spot
    → BYBIT-LIVE-T1

Linear ─┐
        ├→ BYBIT-LIVE-T2
Inverse ┘

Option
    → BYBIT-LIVE-T3
```

Books:

```text
Normal WebSocket
────────────────────────────────

Spot ────┐
Linear ──┤
Inverse ─┼→ BYBIT-LIVE-B1
Option ──┘


Standard REST
────────────────────────────────

Spot ────┐
Linear ──┤
Inverse ─┼→ BYBIT-LIVE-B2
Option ──┘


Full Depth
────────────────────────────────

